  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation interface, separating environment sensing from motion commands. The specification binds sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforcing conservative but efficient recovery and rapid return to exploration. Recovery states are one-shot and only reached as needed. Forward and random_walk are prioritized in clear states; backward is used only for front-obstacle recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception (sensors) and actuation (motion commands)",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe, progress-maximizing exploration with conservative obstacle recovery and rapid return to exploration"
